{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# amz-lead Quickstart Demo\n",
    "\n",
    "10 分钟跑通：采集 → 还原 → 评分 → 补号 → 分批\n",
    "\n",
    "**前置条件**：\n",
    "- `pip install -e \".[dev]\"`\n",
    "- `playwright install chromium`\n",
    "- 配置 `configs/settings.local.yaml` 填入探迹/天眼查账号（可选，补号阶段需要）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 环境检查\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, '../src')\n",
    "\n",
    "from amz_lead.utils.config import get_settings\n",
    "from amz_lead.utils.logging import setup_logging\n",
    "\n",
    "logger = setup_logging(\"quickstart\")\n",
    "settings = get_settings(\"../configs/settings.yaml\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"数据根目录: {settings.storage.get('data_root', 'data')}\")\n",
    "print(f\"采集并发: {settings.collect.get('max_concurrent_instances', 4)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"补号批次大小: {settings.lookup.get('tungee', {}).get('batch_limit', 10)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 采集 Demo（抓取 Home & Garden 前 50 个卖家）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 方式 A: 调用 CLI（推荐，独立进程）\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "cmd = [\n",
    "    \"amz-collect\",\n",
    "    \"--category\", \"home-garden\",\n",
    "    \"--limit\", \"50\",\n",
    "    \"--output\", \"../data/raw/demo_home_garden_raw.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--mode\", \"test\",\n",
    "    \"--headless\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "result = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=300)\n",
    "print(result.stdout)\n",
    "if result.stderr:\n",
    "    print(\"STDERR:\", result.stderr)\n",
    "print(f\"返回码: {result.returncode}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 检查采集结果\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "raw_file = Path(\"../data/raw/demo_home_garden_raw.csv\")\n",
    "if raw_file.exists():\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(raw_file)\n",
    "    print(f\"采集条数: {len(df)}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"字段: {list(df.columns)}\")\n",
    "    print(df.head(3).to_string())\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"采集文件未生成，请检查上一步错误\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 还原 Demo（拼音店名 → 中文主体）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cmd = [\n",
    "    \"amz-resolve\",\n",
    "    \"--input\", \"../data/raw/demo_home_garden_raw.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--output\", \"../data/processed/demo_home_garden_resolved.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--config\", \"../configs/settings.yaml\",\n",
    "    \"--no-qcc\", \"--no-tyc\"  # Demo 跳过外部 API 核验\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "result = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=120)\n",
    "print(result.stdout)\n",
    "if result.stderr:\n",
    "    print(\"STDERR:\", result.stderr)\n",
    "print(f\"返回码: {result.returncode}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "resolved_file = Path(\"../data/processed/demo_home_garden_resolved.csv\")\n",
    "if resolved_file.exists():\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(resolved_file)\n",
    "    print(f\"还原后条数: {len(df)}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"新增字段: {[c for c in df.columns if c not in pd.read_csv(raw_file, nrows=0).columns]}\")\n",
    "    # 显示还原结果示例\n",
    "    cols = [c for c in ['store_name', 'chinese_name', 'unified_code', 'city', 'confidence', 'match_type'] if c in df.columns]\n",
    "    print(df[cols].head(10).to_string())\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"还原文件未生成\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 评分 Demo（多维评分分层）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cmd = [\n",
    "    \"amz-resolve\",\n",
    "    \"--input\", \"../data/processed/demo_home_garden_resolved.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--output\", \"../data/processed/demo_home_garden_scored.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--config\", \"../configs/settings.yaml\",\n",
    "    \"--rescore\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "result = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=60)\n",
    "print(result.stdout)\n",
    "if result.stderr:\n",
    "    print(\"STDERR:\", result.stderr)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "scored_file = Path(\"../data/processed/demo_home_garden_scored.csv\")\n",
    "if scored_file.exists():\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(scored_file)\n",
    "    score_cols = [c for c in ['total_score', 'tier', 'freight_potential_usd', 'entity_confidence'] if c in df.columns]\n",
    "    print(df[score_cols].head(10).to_string())\n",
    "    if 'tier' in df.columns:\n",
    "        print(\"\\n分层分布:\")\n",
    "        print(df['tier'].value_counts().to_string())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 补号 Demo（探迹批量解锁）\n",
    "\n",
    "> **注意**：需要配置有效的探迹账号和额度。\n",
    "> 如果没有账号，可跳过此步，直接用评分后的文件做分批。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 仅演示命令，实际运行需填入有效账号\n",
    "cmd = [\n",
    "    \"amz-lookup\",\n",
    "    \"--input\", \"../data/processed/demo_home_garden_scored.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--output\", \"../data/enriched/demo_home_garden_enriched.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--config\", \"../configs/settings.yaml\",\n",
    "    \"--batch-size\", \"5\",\n",
    "    \"--max-batches\", \"2\",  # Demo 只跑 2 批\n",
    "    \"--dry-run\"  # 先试运行统计可解锁数\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"将执行:\", \" \".join(cmd))\n",
    "# result = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=300)\n",
    "# print(result.stdout)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 生成外呼工单分批"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "cmd = [\n",
    "    \"amz-lookup\",\n",
    "    \"--input\", \"../data/processed/demo_home_garden_scored.csv\",  # 用评分文件演示\n",
    "    \"--output\", \"../data/enriched/batches/demo_batch.csv\",\n",
    "    \"--config\", \"../configs/settings.yaml\",\n",
    "    \"--build-batches\",\n",
    "    \"--batch-size\", \"20\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "result = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=60)\n",
    "print(result.stdout)\n",
    "if result.stderr:\n",
    "    print(\"STDERR:\", result.stderr)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import glob\n",
    "batch_files = glob.glob(\"../data/enriched/batches/*.csv\")\n",
    "for f in batch_files[:3]:\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(f)\n",
    "    print(f\"{f}: {len(df)} 条\")\n",
    "    print(df.head(2).to_string())\n",
    "    print()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 一键流水线（完整版）\n",
    "\n",
    "> 实际使用时建议直接用 `amz-pipeline`，自动串联所有阶段。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 演示流水线命令（不实际执行，避免重复）\n",
    "pipeline_cmd = [\n",
    "    \"amz-pipeline\",\n",
    "    \"--category\", \"home-garden\",\n",
    "    \"--limit\", \"100\",\n",
    "    \"--mode\", \"test\",\n",
    "    \"--stages\", \"collect,resolve,score\",  # Demo 跳过补号\n",
    "    \"--skip-lookup\",\n",
    "    \"--output\", \"demo_pipeline\",\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"完整流水线命令:\")\n",
    print(\" \".join(pipeline_cmd))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== 生产环境建议 ===\")\n",
    "print(\"amz-pipeline --category home-garden --limit 0 --mode incremental --days 7\")\n",
    "print(\"amz-pipeline --config configs/cats.yaml --all-enabled --mode incremental\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 下一步\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **配置生产账号**：编辑 `configs/settings.local.yaml` 填入探迹/天眼查/企查查 Key\n",
    "2. **调度自动化**：用 `cron` 或 `bsr_watchdog.sh` 实现每日增量更新\n",
    "3. **接入下游**：将 `data/enriched/` 下的 CSV 通过 API/Webhook/飞书表格推送给销售团队\n",
    "4. **监控告警**：配置 `monitoring.webhook_url` 接收采集/补号异常通知\n",
    "\n",
    "详见：\n",
    "- [完整文档](README.md)\n",
    "- [合规指南](docs/COMPLIANCE.md)\n",
    "- [云服务版对接](https://amz-lead.example.com/cloud)"
   ]
  }
